                                "sense_id": "41ef3a43-6f40-36fa-b851-f3654ef862e0",
                                "text": "One of the most common synaesthetic effects is to perceive each letter as having a colour."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ceaea31d-df02-4866-a623-14c73b8db564",
                                "sense_id": "41ef3a43-6f40-36fa-b851-f3654ef862e0",
                                "text": "Wherever he was, whatever he was doing, he found himself suddenly accosted by some kind of synaesthetic fixation with the woman: hearing the colour of her hair in the mosque, smelling the touch of her hand on the tube, tasting her smile while innocently walking the streets."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
